      "tactic_notes": "<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><!--{cke_protected}{C}%3C!%2D%2D%20x-tinymce%2Fhtml%20%2D%2D%3E--><strong>Grigoriy(59)</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Village Blacksmith/Former Soldier】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">The residents Blacksmith of Lesnimir village, he is the husband of Pauline, and a former soldier serving the empire, He decided that fighting and killing isn't his desire, and decided to retire and settle down as a Blacksmith instead.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Character Notes】</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Jolly Giant</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Grigoriy has a jolly personality and often makes jokes in conversation. He gives off the image of a gentle giant</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Deploy on the Boarder</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">Grigoriy is a formal soldier and is deploy on the boarder of Wiarachia, he has experience of small skirmishes fighting against monsters or defending against mages army deploy by Sol during the wartime.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Life as a Blacksmith</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">During the war, Grigoriy realize that he is not up to the bloodshed and killing of war, so instead in decided to leave the military and became a blacksmith, using the knowledge of weaponary he learned during his time in the military to make a living.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<hr>\n<ul style=\"text-align: left;\">\n<li><strong>Loving Family</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">He has a loving wife Pauline who owns the bakery in the village and a adopted Pet Polar Bear name Putin, they all love each other very much, Grigoriy favourite past time and greeting is actually to wrestle with Putin or have Arm Wrestle with his wife.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Favourite Food】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>\"Mammoth Steak\"</strong>&nbsp;Expertly prepared mammoth meat infused with robust flavors and accompanied by forest-infused sides,</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【View on Magic】</strong></p>\n<p>As a former soldier, Grigoriy hated magic user as it has been use against him in the war.</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\"><strong>【Sample Dialog】</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Ah, greetings, Comrade! You've stumbled upon the forge of Grigoriy, the village blacksmith. What brings you to my workshop, needs a weapon refine?\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬&nbsp;\"Pauline and I, we're a pair forged in the fires of Lesnimir! Ah but you should have seen our arm wrestling match, she got a grip like no other! Haha!\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Putin? He's no ordinary pet, you see. Found him as a lost cub in the Frozen Waste. Now, he's family&mdash;a gentle giant with a heart of gold, though I wouldn't suggest challenging him to a wrestling match!\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Hm? Tales about my time during the war? Sure, I don't mind sharing, come, gather round!\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Why did I retire from the military? well, all the killing and fighting is getting a bit much, you know? and I'm getting older, thought its about time\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">To Nicholas</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Ah, Nicholas, my old comrade! Come, sit, and let's toast to the old days\"</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: left;\">💬\"Can't believed we're this old now, huh? I still remember the time when we're fighting sides by sides\"</p>\n<div style=\"text-align: left;\" data-cke-filler-webkit=\"end\" data-cke-temp=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>",
